1124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (We will walk through the entire lifecycle: from spotting that initial idea hidden in plain sight, to navigating the maze of government regulations, to pricing your product for profit in a price-sensitive market, to scaling your venture and building a legacy that outlives you. Each chapter is designed to be actionable. You will find real Naija case studies, comparisons between global standards and our local context, and most importantly, Worksheets and Do-It-Yourself \(DIY\) assignments that force you to apply the lessons directly to your own venture. You will not just read; you will do. So, take a deep breath. Be honest with yourself. Are you ready to do the work? Are you ready to replace "I think" with "I know"? Are you ready to build not just a hustle, but a sustainable, thriving business the Naija Way?)
/E (We will walk through the entire lifecycle: from spotting that initial idea hidden in plain sight, to navigating the maze of government regulations, to pricing your product for profit in a price-sensitive market, to scaling your venture and building a legacy that outlives you. Each chapter is designed to be actionable. You will find real Naija case studies, comparisons between global standards and our local context, and most importantly, Worksheets and Do-It-Yourself \(DIY\) assignments that force you to apply the lessons directly to your own venture. You will not just read; you will do. So, take a deep breath. Be honest with yourself. Are you ready to do the work? Are you ready to replace "I think" with "I know"? Are you ready to build not just a hustle, but a sustainable, thriving business the Naija Way?)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4 5 6]
>>
