/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The journey of a thousand miles, they say, begins with a single step. In the Naija business context, that first step isn't a gentle one; it's often a leap taken after a frustrated cry of "Chai! This thing is hard to find!" or "Why does nobody do this properly?" This moment of frustration is not a complaint to be dismissed; it is the first flicker of a potential business idea. Your ability to recognize and interrogate that frustration is your first and most crucial entrepreneurial skill.)
/E (The journey of a thousand miles, they say, begins with a single step. In the Naija business context, that first step isn't a gentle one; it's often a leap taken after a frustrated cry of "Chai! This thing is hard to find!" or "Why does nobody do this properly?" This moment of frustration is not a complaint to be dismissed; it is the first flicker of a potential business idea. Your ability to recognize and interrogate that frustration is your first and most crucial entrepreneurial skill.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
