/T (By the end of the week, you will have a raw list of potential business ideas rooted in real market demand. Your homework is to analyze your top five frustrations. For each one, ask yourself: How many other people in my city, my estate, or my social circle share this exact pain? What would a realistic, convenient solution look like? And crucially, what would they be willing to pay to make this frustration go away?)
