/T (Leveraging Your "Naija Advantage": Your Unfair Edge While global entrepreneurs talk about "Unique Selling Propositions," you have something more fundamental: your "Naija Advantage." This is the unique combination of your location, your background, your network, and your innate understanding of the local culture. It is your unfair edge, and a foreign competitor cannot easily replicate it.)
