/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Let's break it down. Do you hail from a community in Benue State known for its bountiful yam harvest? Your advantage isn't just the yams; it's your relationship with the farmers, your understanding of the harvest cycles, and your ability to negotiate fair prices directly at the source. An outsider would spend months and significant resources trying to build that trust. Are you a resident of a large, densely populated estate in Abuja with poor logistics services? Your advantage is your hyper-local knowledge of the layout, the security personnel, and the specific delivery challenges within those walls. A large national logistics company might struggle with "last-mile" delivery there, but you can master it. Your network your family, your alumni association, your religious group is not just a social circle; it is a per-qualified test market and a potential initial sales channel. Do not underestimate this.)
/E (Let's break it down. Do you hail from a community in Benue State known for its bountiful yam harvest? Your advantage isn't just the yams; it's your relationship with the farmers, your understanding of the harvest cycles, and your ability to negotiate fair prices directly at the source. An outsider would spend months and significant resources trying to build that trust. Are you a resident of a large, densely populated estate in Abuja with poor logistics services? Your advantage is your hyper-local knowledge of the layout, the security personnel, and the specific delivery challenges within those walls. A large national logistics company might struggle with "last-mile" delivery there, but you can master it. Your network your family, your alumni association, your religious group is not just a social circle; it is a per-qualified test market and a potential initial sales channel. Do not underestimate this.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1 2 3]
>>
endobj
