/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (DIY Assignment: The Personal Asset Map Take a blank sheet of paper and draw a large circle. From this circle, draw branches for each of these categories: Skills \(What am I good at? Cooking, coding, persuading people?\), Location \(Where do I live, work, and have access to?\), Network \(Who do I know in different industries and communities?\), and Resources \(What do I have access to? A car, a small savings, a spare room?\).)
/E (DIY Assignment: The Personal Asset Map Take a blank sheet of paper and draw a large circle. From this circle, draw branches for each of these categories: Skills \(What am I good at? Cooking, coding, persuading people?\), Location \(Where do I live, work, and have access to?\), Network \(Who do I know in different industries and communities?\), and Resources \(What do I have access to? A car, a small savings, a spare room?\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
