/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Now, study this map. This is your entrepreneurial landscape. The most viable business ideas will often be found at the intersection of two or more of these assets. Brainstorm three ideas that combine your skills with your location, or your network with your resources. For instance, your skill \(graphic design\) plus your network \(local churches and mosques\) could lead to a business in customized programme booklets and flyers.)
