/S /H3
/T (Global vs. Naija: The Art of Intelligent Adaptation You do not need to reinvent the wheel. Some of the most successful businesses in Nigeria are brilliant adaptations of proven global models to our local context. Take the global success of Netflix, a subscription-based streaming service for movies and series. The model is powerful: convenience, variety, and a monthly fee. The direct application in Nigeria would have failed, as the internet speeds and data costs a decade ago were prohibitive for streaming high-quality video.)
/E (Global vs. Naija: The Art of Intelligent Adaptation You do not need to reinvent the wheel. Some of the most successful businesses in Nigeria are brilliant adaptations of proven global models to our local context. Take the global success of Netflix, a subscription-based streaming service for movies and series. The model is powerful: convenience, variety, and a monthly fee. The direct application in Nigeria would have failed, as the internet speeds and data costs a decade ago were prohibitive for streaming high-quality video.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6 7]
