/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 1 Summary & Your Mandate The seed of your business is not a distant, abstract concept. It is likely already present in your life, disguised as a daily frustration or a unique advantage you possess. Your task is to unearth it, interrogate it, and validate it with cold, hard reality. Before you even think of a business name or a logo, you must complete the Frustration Journal \(DIY Assignment 1.1\) and the Personal Asset Map \(DIY Assignment 1.2\). If the data from your validation efforts suggests your initial idea is weak, do not be disheartened. This is not failure; it is a successful experiment that saved you time and money. Pivot, adapt, or find a new idea. The goal is to start your journey not on a feeling, but on a foundation of evidence. That is the Naija Way.)
/E (Chapter 1 Summary & Your Mandate The seed of your business is not a distant, abstract concept. It is likely already present in your life, disguised as a daily frustration or a unique advantage you possess. Your task is to unearth it, interrogate it, and validate it with cold, hard reality. Before you even think of a business name or a logo, you must complete the Frustration Journal \(DIY Assignment 1.1\) and the Personal Asset Map \(DIY Assignment 1.2\). If the data from your validation efforts suggests your initial idea is weak, do not be disheartened. This is not failure; it is a successful experiment that saved you time and money. Pivot, adapt, or find a new idea. The goal is to start your journey not on a feeling, but on a foundation of evidence. That is the Naija Way.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3 4]
