/T (The Trust Deficit: Nigerians have been burned by fake products, failed promises, and shoddy service. We are naturally skeptical. Your first job is not to sell, but to build trust. How? Through social proof \(testimonials, pictures of happy customers\), professional presentation \(a clean, functional WhatsApp Business account\), and consistency \(doing what you say you will do, every single time\).)
/E (The Trust Deficit: Nigerians have been burned by fake products, failed promises, and shoddy service. We are naturally skeptical. Your first job is not to sell, but to build trust. How? Through social proof \(testimonials, pictures of happy customers\), professional presentation \(a clean, functional WhatsApp Business account\), and consistency \(doing what you say you will do, every single time\).)
