/T (The Importance of Relationship: We don't just do business with companies; we do business with people. The "Aunty Bisi" who sells fabric knows her customers' children's names and their upcoming ceremonies. That personal touch is why they will never buy from the new, faceless shop down the street, even if it's slightly cheaper. Your customer is not a transaction; they are a relationship.)
