/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Global vs. Naija: The Plan as a Living, Breathing Document In stable economies, a business plan might be a five-year roadmap. In Nigeria, our reality is different. The price of diesel can double in a month. A new government policy can change import duties. A competitor can emerge overnight. A global business textbook might call for rigid adherence to a plan, but the Naija Way demands Agile Planning.)
/E (Global vs. Naija: The Plan as a Living, Breathing Document In stable economies, a business plan might be a five-year roadmap. In Nigeria, our reality is different. The price of diesel can double in a month. A new government policy can change import duties. A competitor can emerge overnight. A global business textbook might call for rigid adherence to a plan, but the Naija Way demands Agile Planning.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Your Battle Plan is not a chain that binds you; it is a compass that guides you. You must review it monthly. Compare your actual sales and expenses to your projections. What is different? Why? Your initial plan is your best guess based on what you knew at the time. After a month in the market, you have real data. You must have the courage to pivot.)
/E (Your Battle Plan is not a chain that binds you; it is a compass that guides you. You must review it monthly. Compare your actual sales and expenses to your projections. What is different? Why? Your initial plan is your best guess based on what you knew at the time. After a month in the market, you have real data. You must have the courage to pivot.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
1432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 5991 0 R
/T (Pivoting is not failure. It is a strategic correction. If Zainab finds that her Vegetable Soup is a runaway hit while her Ogbono sells poorly, she should pivot her menu and marketing to focus on her winner. If she discovers corporate clients want bulk orders for their staff, she should pivot her sales strategy to pursue them. The plan told her the initial direction; the market data tells her how to adjust her course. The foolish entrepreneur sticks to a failing plan. The wise Naija entrepreneur adapts and conquers.)
/E (Pivoting is not failure. It is a strategic correction. If Zainab finds that her Vegetable Soup is a runaway hit while her Ogbono sells poorly, she should pivot her menu and marketing to focus on her winner. If she discovers corporate clients want bulk orders for their staff, she should pivot her sales strategy to pursue them. The plan told her the initial direction; the market data tells her how to adjust her course. The foolish entrepreneur sticks to a failing plan. The wise Naija entrepreneur adapts and conquers.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [4]
>>
