/T (To Use a Lawyer or Not? The Naija Dilemma.  You can do it yourself, especially for a simple Business Name registration. However, for an LTD, using a vetted and affordable lawyer or a reputable registration agent is often a wise investment. They understand the nuances, can help draft a proper MEMART, and can navigate any hiccups with the CAC, saving you time and potential frustration. The cost is a worthwhile part of your startup investment.)
/E (To Use a Lawyer or Not? The Naija Dilemma.  You can do it yourself, especially for a simple Business Name registration. However, for an LTD, using a vetted and affordable lawyer or a reputable registration agent is often a wise investment. They understand the nuances, can help draft a proper MEMART, and can navigate any hiccups with the CAC, saving you time and potential frustration. The cost is a worthwhile part of your startup investment.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [3]
>>
