1777 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 5 Summary & Your Mandate The money question is a test of your commitment and creativity. It separates the dreamers from the doers. There is no single right way to fund your business, only the way that is right for you, your venture, and your current circumstances. The path may involve personal sacrifice, relentless hustle, and a steadfast focus on generating revenue from day one. Your mandate is to move from anxiety to action. Complete your detailed startup cost analysis, evaluate your funding options with clear-eyed realism, and craft a compelling story about your business. Then, take the first concrete step to secure your capital. Do not be paralyzed by the size of the challenge. Every great Naija empire began with a single, courageously sourced Naira. Your journey to build a profitable, lasting enterprise begins with winning the Naija money talk.)
/E (Chapter 5 Summary & Your Mandate The money question is a test of your commitment and creativity. It separates the dreamers from the doers. There is no single right way to fund your business, only the way that is right for you, your venture, and your current circumstances. The path may involve personal sacrifice, relentless hustle, and a steadfast focus on generating revenue from day one. Your mandate is to move from anxiety to action. Complete your detailed startup cost analysis, evaluate your funding options with clear-eyed realism, and craft a compelling story about your business. Then, take the first concrete step to secure your capital. Do not be paralyzed by the size of the challenge. Every great Naija empire began with a single, courageously sourced Naira. Your journey to build a profitable, lasting enterprise begins with winning the Naija money talk.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
