/T (Chapter 7 Summary & Your Mandate Dealing with government agencies is an unavoidable and defining part of the Naija entrepreneurial journey. Viewing it as a strategic function of your business, rather than a nuisance, is the mindset shift required for long-term survival and growth. Your mandate is to stop being reactive. This week, you must execute DIY Assignment and build your Regulatory Bunker. Get your documents in order, understand your basic obligations, and engage professional help where necessary. By being proactive, organized, and professional, you transform yourself from a target into a respected entity. )
