/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (If the heart of your business is your product and the lifeblood is your cash flow, then your infrastructure is the skeleton and nervous system that allows it to function, move, and grow. In Nigeria, the state of public infrastructure is the single greatest external factor that will test your resilience, ingenuity, and operational acumen. A brilliant idea, a validated market, and perfect paperwork mean very little if you cannot power your operations, get your product to customers, or maintain a stable internet connection to communicate.)
/E (If the heart of your business is your product and the lifeblood is your cash flow, then your infrastructure is the skeleton and nervous system that allows it to function, move, and grow. In Nigeria, the state of public infrastructure is the single greatest external factor that will test your resilience, ingenuity, and operational acumen. A brilliant idea, a validated market, and perfect paperwork mean very little if you cannot power your operations, get your product to customers, or maintain a stable internet connection to communicate.)
