2046 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This chapter is a deep, practical dive into building a robust operational foundation in an environment where the basic utilities many global businesses take for granted cannot be relied upon. We will not just complain about "NEPA" or bad roads. Instead, we will treat power, logistics, and internet as critical, manageable business costs and develop strategic, layered solutions for each. Mastering this trifecta is what separates the struggling hustler from the scalable enterprise. It is about building a business that can survive and thrive, not in spite of Nigeria's challenges, but with a clear-eyed plan to overcome them.)
/E (This chapter is a deep, practical dive into building a robust operational foundation in an environment where the basic utilities many global businesses take for granted cannot be relied upon. We will not just complain about "NEPA" or bad roads. Instead, we will treat power, logistics, and internet as critical, manageable business costs and develop strategic, layered solutions for each. Mastering this trifecta is what separates the struggling hustler from the scalable enterprise. It is about building a business that can survive and thrive, not in spite of Nigeria's challenges, but with a clear-eyed plan to overcome them.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
