/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 8 Summary & Your Mandate Power, logistics, and internet are the triumvirate that will make or break your operational efficiency and customer experience. Viewing them as strategic challenges to be solved, rather than curses to be endured, is the hallmark of a mature entrepreneur. Your mandate is to conduct a thorough Power Audit \(Worksheet 8.1\) and create a Logistics & Internet Plan. For logistics, list your potential delivery partners for intra-city and inter-state shipments and research their rates. For internet, confirm what broadband options are available at your location and purchase a MiFi device on a different network as your immediate backup. This proactive work transforms infrastructure from a daily crisis into a managed, predictable part of your business, freeing you to focus on growth and innovation.)
/E (Chapter 8 Summary & Your Mandate Power, logistics, and internet are the triumvirate that will make or break your operational efficiency and customer experience. Viewing them as strategic challenges to be solved, rather than curses to be endured, is the hallmark of a mature entrepreneur. Your mandate is to conduct a thorough Power Audit \(Worksheet 8.1\) and create a Logistics & Internet Plan. For logistics, list your potential delivery partners for intra-city and inter-state shipments and research their rates. For internet, confirm what broadband options are available at your location and purchase a MiFi device on a different network as your immediate backup. This proactive work transforms infrastructure from a daily crisis into a managed, predictable part of your business, freeing you to focus on growth and innovation.)
