2266 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 9 Summary & Your Mandate Hiring your first employee is a test of your leadership. It forces you to clarify your vision, define your processes, and step into the role of a manager. The easy, familiar path of hiring family and friends is often the most dangerous one for both the business and the relationship. Your mandate is to complete the Hire-or-Outsource Matrix and draft your first Job Description. This disciplined approach will force you to think strategically about your needs. Whether you ultimately hire a professional or give a structured opportunity to someone you know, you will do so from a position of strength and clarity, not desperation or guilt. This is how you build a team that will help you carry the load, not one that adds to it.)
/E (Chapter 9 Summary & Your Mandate Hiring your first employee is a test of your leadership. It forces you to clarify your vision, define your processes, and step into the role of a manager. The easy, familiar path of hiring family and friends is often the most dangerous one for both the business and the relationship. Your mandate is to complete the Hire-or-Outsource Matrix and draft your first Job Description. This disciplined approach will force you to think strategically about your needs. Whether you ultimately hire a professional or give a structured opportunity to someone you know, you will do so from a position of strength and clarity, not desperation or guilt. This is how you build a team that will help you carry the load, not one that adds to it.)
/Pg 100 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
