/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This chapter is a compassionate but firm intervention. We will demystify basic accounting and transform it from a source of anxiety into your most powerful tool for decision-making. This is not about becoming a chartered accountant. It is about mastering the fundamental language of your business. We will move beyond theory and provide you with a simple, practical, and Naija-relevant system for tracking your money. You will learn how to answer the only three questions that truly matter: Are you making a profit? Where is your cash going? What is your business truly worth? Mastering this chapter is what separates a sustainable business from a fleeting hustle.)
/E (This chapter is a compassionate but firm intervention. We will demystify basic accounting and transform it from a source of anxiety into your most powerful tool for decision-making. This is not about becoming a chartered accountant. It is about mastering the fundamental language of your business. We will move beyond theory and provide you with a simple, practical, and Naija-relevant system for tracking your money. You will learn how to answer the only three questions that truly matter: Are you making a profit? Where is your cash going? What is your business truly worth? Mastering this chapter is what separates a sustainable business from a fleeting hustle.)
