/T (The Growth Ceiling. You cannot manage what you do not measure. How can you know which product line is your most profitable? How can you identify wasteful spending? How can you create a realistic budget for expansion or present your business to a potential investor or loan officer? The answer is, you cannot. Financial indiscipline places a hard ceiling on your business's growth potential.)
/E (The Growth Ceiling. You cannot manage what you do not measure. How can you know which product line is your most profitable? How can you identify wasteful spending? How can you create a realistic budget for expansion or present your business to a potential investor or loan officer? The answer is, you cannot. Financial indiscipline places a hard ceiling on your business's growth potential.)
