/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 10 Summary & Your Mandate Financial record-keeping is the discipline that transforms a passionate hustle into a professional, sustainable enterprise. It is the unsexy, behind-the-scenes work that makes the glamorous growth possible. It is your compass, your shield, and your crystal ball. Your mandate is to break the cycle of the "black box." This week, you must begin DIY Assignment. Go out, buy three notebooks, or open a new spreadsheet. Start tracking your sales and expenses today. The first month will be messy, but it will be enlightening. Within 90 days, this discipline will become a habit, and you will experience a newfound sense of control and confidence. You will no longer be guessing about your business's health; you will be managing it with the clarity and precision of a true CEO. This is the foundation upon which empires are built.)
