/T (This chapter is a deep dive into the art and science of building a brand that resonates deeply with the Naija consumer. We will move far beyond just designing a logo. We will explore how to craft a compelling brand story, develop a consistent visual identity, and understand the critical role of packaging as your "silent salesman." For the Naija entrepreneur, your brand is your reputation, your promise, and your primary weapon in the battle for market share. A well-branded "pure water" sachet in a crowded shop will be chosen over an unbranded one, even if the water inside is identical. This chapter will show you why and, more importantly, how. Deconstructing the Myth: What Branding Really Is \(And Isn't\) Before we build, we must clear the debris of misunderstanding.)
/E (This chapter is a deep dive into the art and science of building a brand that resonates deeply with the Naija consumer. We will move far beyond just designing a logo. We will explore how to craft a compelling brand story, develop a consistent visual identity, and understand the critical role of packaging as your "silent salesman." For the Naija entrepreneur, your brand is your reputation, your promise, and your primary weapon in the battle for market share. A well-branded "pure water" sachet in a crowded shop will be chosen over an unbranded one, even if the water inside is identical. This chapter will show you why and, more importantly, how. Deconstructing the Myth: What Branding Really Is \(And Isn't\) Before we build, we must clear the debris of misunderstanding.)
/Pg 124 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
