/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 12 Summary & Your Mandate Your brand is the most valuable asset you will ever build. It is the intangible quality that allows you to charge more, attract better customers, and build a business that outlives any single product. In the crowded Naija marketplace, a generic product is a commodity; a branded product is a destination. Your mandate is to stop treating your business as a faceless entity. Execute the 21-Day Brand Transformation. Define who you are, create a consistent visual identity, and ensure every customer touch-point reflects the quality and promise of your brand. Do not let another day go by where your business is just another voice in the crowd. Invest the time and thought to make it a voice that is recognized, trusted, and preferred. Your brand is your flag in the ground; plant it firmly and proudly.)
/E (Chapter 12 Summary & Your Mandate Your brand is the most valuable asset you will ever build. It is the intangible quality that allows you to charge more, attract better customers, and build a business that outlives any single product. In the crowded Naija marketplace, a generic product is a commodity; a branded product is a destination. Your mandate is to stop treating your business as a faceless entity. Execute the 21-Day Brand Transformation. Define who you are, create a consistent visual identity, and ensure every customer touch-point reflects the quality and promise of your brand. Do not let another day go by where your business is just another voice in the crowd. Invest the time and thought to make it a voice that is recognized, trusted, and preferred. Your brand is your flag in the ground; plant it firmly and proudly.)
/Pg 133 0 R
/K [3 4]
