/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The digital landscape in Nigeria is not just an alternative marketplace; it is the marketplace. With over 100 million internet users, the potential reach for your business is staggering. Yet, for many Naija entrepreneurs, digital marketing is a confusing cacophony of buzzwords algorithms, SEO, engagement rates that feels both expensive and impersonal. This perception could not be more wrong. Digital marketing, when done the Naija way, is the great equalizer. It is the most cost-effective, measurable, and powerful tool to build a community, not just a customer base. It allows the small business in Ibadan to compete with the established brand in Lagos on a level playing field.)
/E (The digital landscape in Nigeria is not just an alternative marketplace; it is the marketplace. With over 100 million internet users, the potential reach for your business is staggering. Yet, for many Naija entrepreneurs, digital marketing is a confusing cacophony of buzzwords algorithms, SEO, engagement rates that feels both expensive and impersonal. This perception could not be more wrong. Digital marketing, when done the Naija way, is the great equalizer. It is the most cost-effective, measurable, and powerful tool to build a community, not just a customer base. It allows the small business in Ibadan to compete with the established brand in Lagos on a level playing field.)
/Pg 134 0 R
/K [3 4]
