/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 14 Summary & Your Mandate Selling in Nigeria is a psychological and relational endeavor. It requires you to be part marketer, part psychologist, and part friend. It demands that you build trust where there is skepticism and offer value beyond the price tag. Your mandate is to become a student of your customer. Complete the Customer Persona Deep Dive and execute the 7-Day Customer Experience Audit. Stop selling at people and start connecting with them. Remember their name, listen to their stories, solve their problems with zeal, and value the relationship more than the single transaction. When you do this, you will not only make sales; you will build a legacy, one loyal customer at a time.)
/E (Chapter 14 Summary & Your Mandate Selling in Nigeria is a psychological and relational endeavor. It requires you to be part marketer, part psychologist, and part friend. It demands that you build trust where there is skepticism and offer value beyond the price tag. Your mandate is to become a student of your customer. Complete the Customer Persona Deep Dive and execute the 7-Day Customer Experience Audit. Stop selling at people and start connecting with them. Remember their name, listen to their stories, solve their problems with zeal, and value the relationship more than the single transaction. When you do this, you will not only make sales; you will build a legacy, one loyal customer at a time.)
