/T (Chapter 15 Summary & Your Mandate Distribution and delivery are the final, critical steps in fulfilling your brand's promise. A failure here can undo all the marketing, sales, and product development work that came before it. In Nigeria, this is not a mere operational detail; it is a core business function that demands strategy, investment, and relentless attention to detail. Your mandate is to stop treating delivery as an afterthought. Execute the Logistics Stress Test. Audit your current system, identify its fatal flaws, and build a resilient, multi-channel, and customer-centric logistics operation. Invest in packaging that protects, communication that reassures, and partners you can rely on. Make your delivery experience so seamless and reliable that it becomes a talking point a reason for customers to choose you again and again. Conquer the last mile, and you will conquer the market.)
/E (Chapter 15 Summary & Your Mandate Distribution and delivery are the final, critical steps in fulfilling your brand's promise. A failure here can undo all the marketing, sales, and product development work that came before it. In Nigeria, this is not a mere operational detail; it is a core business function that demands strategy, investment, and relentless attention to detail. Your mandate is to stop treating delivery as an afterthought. Execute the Logistics Stress Test. Audit your current system, identify its fatal flaws, and build a resilient, multi-channel, and customer-centric logistics operation. Invest in packaging that protects, communication that reassures, and partners you can rely on. Make your delivery experience so seamless and reliable that it becomes a talking point a reason for customers to choose you again and again. Conquer the last mile, and you will conquer the market.)
