3269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 16 Summary & Your Mandate Cash flow management and strategic reinvestment are the twin engines of sustainable business growth. They require a level of financial discipline and delayed gratification that separates the serious entrepreneur from the amateur. Your mandate is twofold and immediate. First, you must create your 13-Week Cash Flow Forecast and update it religiously every single week. This will give you the predictive power to avoid crises. Second, you must conduct the Profit & Reinvestment Audit and commit to a formal reinvestment plan. Stop plundering your business for short-term show. Start feeding it for long-term growth. The money you leave in the business today is the seed for the empire you will build tomorrow. Protect your cash flow like your life depends on it, because your business life does. Reinvest your profits like a farmer saving his best seeds for the next planting season, because you are planting a forest, not just harvesting a single crop. This is how you build a business that doesn't just boom, but endures.)
/E (Chapter 16 Summary & Your Mandate Cash flow management and strategic reinvestment are the twin engines of sustainable business growth. They require a level of financial discipline and delayed gratification that separates the serious entrepreneur from the amateur. Your mandate is twofold and immediate. First, you must create your 13-Week Cash Flow Forecast and update it religiously every single week. This will give you the predictive power to avoid crises. Second, you must conduct the Profit & Reinvestment Audit and commit to a formal reinvestment plan. Stop plundering your business for short-term show. Start feeding it for long-term growth. The money you leave in the business today is the seed for the empire you will build tomorrow. Protect your cash flow like your life depends on it, because your business life does. Reinvest your profits like a farmer saving his best seeds for the next planting season, because you are planting a forest, not just harvesting a single crop. This is how you build a business that doesn't just boom, but endures.)
