3277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The entrepreneurial journey is a constant battle between ambition and prudence. You have successfully navigated the treacherous waters of startup, achieved product-market fit, and built a stable, profitable operation. The business is no longer a day-to-day struggle for survival. Now, a new, more complex question emerges: What next? The siren song of growth is alluring, but it is also fraught with peril. Scaling a business is fundamentally different from starting one. It requires a new level of strategic thinking, operational discipline, and financial acumen. A misstep at this stage can unravel years of hard work, turning a successful small business into a failed medium-sized one.)
/E (The entrepreneurial journey is a constant battle between ambition and prudence. You have successfully navigated the treacherous waters of startup, achieved product-market fit, and built a stable, profitable operation. The business is no longer a day-to-day struggle for survival. Now, a new, more complex question emerges: What next? The siren song of growth is alluring, but it is also fraught with peril. Scaling a business is fundamentally different from starting one. It requires a new level of strategic thinking, operational discipline, and financial acumen. A misstep at this stage can unravel years of hard work, turning a successful small business into a failed medium-sized one.)
/Pg 173 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
