/S /H3
/T (This chapter is your strategic guide to intelligent growth. We will dissect the three primary pathways for scaling a Naija business: Expansion \(reaching new markets\), Diversification \(adding new products or services\), and Franchising \(growing through partners\). We will provide you with a diagnostic framework to know when you are truly ready to scale, and a practical roadmap for how to execute each strategy while managing the immense risks. This is about moving from being a successful operator to becoming a visionary builder.)
/E (This chapter is your strategic guide to intelligent growth. We will dissect the three primary pathways for scaling a Naija business: Expansion \(reaching new markets\), Diversification \(adding new products or services\), and Franchising \(growing through partners\). We will provide you with a diagnostic framework to know when you are truly ready to scale, and a practical roadmap for how to execute each strategy while managing the immense risks. This is about moving from being a successful operator to becoming a visionary builder.)
/Pg 173 0 R
/K [5]
