/T (Micro-Expansion First: Before leaping to a new state, consider a lower-risk micro-expansion within your current city. Example: A restaurant in Victoria Island could start a "kiosk" or "pick-up point" in Lekki Phase 1 to test demand with lower overhead before committing to a full-scale branch.)
/E (Micro-Expansion First: Before leaping to a new state, consider a lower-risk micro-expansion within your current city. Example: A restaurant in Victoria Island could start a "kiosk" or "pick-up point" in Lekki Phase 1 to test demand with lower overhead before committing to a full-scale branch.)
