/S /H3
/P 6653 0 R
/T (The "Beachhead" Market Approach: Don't try to conquer an entire new city at once. Identify one specific area, estate, or community within that city to target first. Example: A fashion brand from Abuja expanding to Lagos should not try to target "all of Lagos." It should start by focusing its marketing and delivery efforts on a specific cluster like Ikeja GRA or Yaba.)
/E (The "Beachhead" Market Approach: Don't try to conquer an entire new city at once. Identify one specific area, estate, or community within that city to target first. Example: A fashion brand from Abuja expanding to Lagos should not try to target "all of Lagos." It should start by focusing its marketing and delivery efforts on a specific cluster like Ikeja GRA or Yaba.)
