3322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T ( "ChopNow," a popular fast-food spot in Surulere, was consistently packed. Flush with success, the owner used all his profits and took a loan to open two new branches simultaneously one in Ajah and one in Ikeja. The problems began immediately. He had to split his time and his best staff between three locations. The operational nuances of Ajah \(traffic, customer demographics\) were different from Surulere. The marketing that worked in Surulere didn't resonate in Ikeja. Cash flow became a nightmare as the new branches burned through money to build a customer base. Within 18 months, both new branches had failed, and the debt burden nearly sank the original, profitable Surulere branch. "ChopNow" expanded because it could, not because it was ready. It lacked the systems, the management depth, and the financial cushion to survive the inevitable hiccups of scaling.)
/E ( "ChopNow," a popular fast-food spot in Surulere, was consistently packed. Flush with success, the owner used all his profits and took a loan to open two new branches simultaneously one in Ajah and one in Ikeja. The problems began immediately. He had to split his time and his best staff between three locations. The operational nuances of Ajah \(traffic, customer demographics\) were different from Surulere. The marketing that worked in Surulere didn't resonate in Ikeja. Cash flow became a nightmare as the new branches burned through money to build a customer base. Within 18 months, both new branches had failed, and the debt burden nearly sank the original, profitable Surulere branch. "ChopNow" expanded because it could, not because it was ready. It lacked the systems, the management depth, and the financial cushion to survive the inevitable hiccups of scaling.)
/Pg 176 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
