3408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 17 Summary & Your Mandate Scaling is not a goal in itself; it is a means to build a more valuable, impactful, and resilient enterprise. The reckless pursuit of growth has been the downfall of countless promising businesses. Intelligent scaling, however, is the engine of legacy. Your mandate is to resist the impulsive urge to grow. Instead, you must first complete the Scaling Readiness Checklist for your own business. Be brutally honest in your assessment. Then, using the Expansion Feasibility Canvas, rigorously analyze your first potential scaling move. Finally, draft your 3-Year Scaling Roadmap to provide a disciplined, long-term context for your growth decisions.)
/E (Chapter 17 Summary & Your Mandate Scaling is not a goal in itself; it is a means to build a more valuable, impactful, and resilient enterprise. The reckless pursuit of growth has been the downfall of countless promising businesses. Intelligent scaling, however, is the engine of legacy. Your mandate is to resist the impulsive urge to grow. Instead, you must first complete the Scaling Readiness Checklist for your own business. Be brutally honest in your assessment. Then, using the Expansion Feasibility Canvas, rigorously analyze your first potential scaling move. Finally, draft your 3-Year Scaling Roadmap to provide a disciplined, long-term context for your growth decisions.)
/Pg 182 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
