<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Their core values were "Quality," "Ownership," and "Teamwork." He then created "Pods" small teams of 5 workers, each responsible for a specific section of the farm. Each Pod had clear KPIs \(yield, wastage\). He gave them the autonomy to manage their section as they saw fit. He instituted a daily huddle and a weekly meeting where Pods shared best practices. He started a profit-sharing scheme where a portion of the savings from reduced waste was shared with the Pods. The change was dramatic. Workers started innovating, holding each other accountable, and took genuine pride in their sections. Productivity soared. Ade was no longer a foreman; he was a leader focused on strategy. The culture of ownership scaled the business.)
/E (Their core values were "Quality," "Ownership," and "Teamwork." He then created "Pods" small teams of 5 workers, each responsible for a specific section of the farm. Each Pod had clear KPIs \(yield, wastage\). He gave them the autonomy to manage their section as they saw fit. He instituted a daily huddle and a weekly meeting where Pods shared best practices. He started a profit-sharing scheme where a portion of the savings from reduced waste was shared with the Pods. The change was dramatic. Workers started innovating, holding each other accountable, and took genuine pride in their sections. Productivity soared. Ade was no longer a foreman; he was a leader focused on strategy. The culture of ownership scaled the business.)
/Pg 187 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
