/T (Chapter 18 Summary & Your Mandate Scaling your operations is a mechanical feat; scaling your culture is a leadership masterpiece. You cannot have one without the other. A business without a strong culture is just a collection of individuals, vulnerable to chaos as it grows. Your mandate is to stop being the chief doer and start being the chief culture builder. Your most important work is no longer in the workshop or on the sales floor; it is in the hearts and minds of your team. Execute the 30-Day Culture Reset. Define your purpose, live your values, systemize your processes, and invest in your people. The empire you are building will be constructed not just with bricks and mortar, but with trust, shared purpose, and the collective spirit of a team that believes in the mission. Lead them well.)
/E (Chapter 18 Summary & Your Mandate Scaling your operations is a mechanical feat; scaling your culture is a leadership masterpiece. You cannot have one without the other. A business without a strong culture is just a collection of individuals, vulnerable to chaos as it grows. Your mandate is to stop being the chief doer and start being the chief culture builder. Your most important work is no longer in the workshop or on the sales floor; it is in the hearts and minds of your team. Execute the 30-Day Culture Reset. Define your purpose, live your values, systemize your processes, and invest in your people. The empire you are building will be constructed not just with bricks and mortar, but with trust, shared purpose, and the collective spirit of a team that believes in the mission. Lead them well.)
/Pg 192 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
