/T (The preceding chapter equipped you to build a formidable external engine a scalable business with a cohesive team. But an engine, no matter how powerful, is useless without a healthy, capable driver. This chapter addresses the most critical yet most neglected component of the entire entrepreneurial machine: you. The Naija entrepreneurial journey is not a sprint on a smooth track; it is an ultramarathon through a jungle filled with unexpected obstacles, constant pressure, and profound isolation. The relentless pursuit of success, when coupled with our unique cultural pressures, creates a perfect storm for mental and physical depletion.)
/E (The preceding chapter equipped you to build a formidable external engine a scalable business with a cohesive team. But an engine, no matter how powerful, is useless without a healthy, capable driver. This chapter addresses the most critical yet most neglected component of the entire entrepreneurial machine: you. The Naija entrepreneurial journey is not a sprint on a smooth track; it is an ultramarathon through a jungle filled with unexpected obstacles, constant pressure, and profound isolation. The relentless pursuit of success, when coupled with our unique cultural pressures, creates a perfect storm for mental and physical depletion.)
