/T (This chapter is a vital intervention. We will move beyond the stereotypical "hustle" narrative that glorifies suffering and move towards a sustainable model of entrepreneurial leadership. We will explore the psychological toll of building a business in Nigeria, identify the clear warning signs of burnout, and provide a practical, actionable framework for building the resilience required not just to survive, but to thrive. Your business is a reflection of your state of mind. To build a healthy, enduring enterprise, you must first become a healthy, enduring founder.)
/E (This chapter is a vital intervention. We will move beyond the stereotypical "hustle" narrative that glorifies suffering and move towards a sustainable model of entrepreneurial leadership. We will explore the psychological toll of building a business in Nigeria, identify the clear warning signs of burnout, and provide a practical, actionable framework for building the resilience required not just to survive, but to thrive. Your business is a reflection of your state of mind. To build a healthy, enduring enterprise, you must first become a healthy, enduring founder.)
