3657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Chapter 19 Summary & Your Mandate The journey of a Naija entrepreneur is a test of spirit as much as it is a test of skill. To ignore your well-being in the pursuit of success is to saw off the very branch you are sitting on. Burnout is not a trophy; it is a tombstone for unfulfilled potential. Your mandate is to declare that your health is a non-negotiable part of your business strategy. Complete the Burnout Self-Assessment with radical honesty. Then, commit to and execute the 30-Day Resilience Building Plan. You must build your personal resilience with the same focus and discipline you apply to your business metrics. The world will not stop if you take a break, but your business might if you don't. Prioritize your well-being not as an afterthought, but as the foundation of everything you are building. A healthy founder builds a healthy company. A resilient leader builds an empire that can withstand any storm.)
/E (Chapter 19 Summary & Your Mandate The journey of a Naija entrepreneur is a test of spirit as much as it is a test of skill. To ignore your well-being in the pursuit of success is to saw off the very branch you are sitting on. Burnout is not a trophy; it is a tombstone for unfulfilled potential. Your mandate is to declare that your health is a non-negotiable part of your business strategy. Complete the Burnout Self-Assessment with radical honesty. Then, commit to and execute the 30-Day Resilience Building Plan. You must build your personal resilience with the same focus and discipline you apply to your business metrics. The world will not stop if you take a break, but your business might if you don't. Prioritize your well-being not as an afterthought, but as the foundation of everything you are building. A healthy founder builds a healthy company. A resilient leader builds an empire that can withstand any storm.)
